    "title": "Driver killed in Cross traffic incident, coroner says - NewsBreak",
    "text": "BERKELEY COUNTY, S.C. (WCBD) – A driver died Tuesday after a traffic incident in Cross, according to the Berkeley County Coroner’s Office. Coroner Darnell Hartwell responded to the incident on Ranger Drive shortly after 2:10 p.m. The driver, identified as Sarah Alexander, 34, of Moncks Corner, was pronounced deceased on the scene from fatal injuries. Central Berkeley Fire & Rescue, Moncks Corner Rural Fire & Rescue, Berkeley County EMS, Berkeley County Sheriff’s Office, and the Berkeley County Emergency Management Division also responded to this incident. The South Carolina Highway Patrol is the lead investigative law enforcement agency. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WCBD News 2.",
